  "description": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong>Brand introduction</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Welcome to Dot Me In Dashes, the home of meaningful Morse code jewelry and accessories. Our brand is all about crafting connections and celebrating life's moments with elegance and style. As an affiliate marketer, you can join us in sharing these unique treasures that allow individuals to wear their stories and emotions. Partner with us to promote symbolically rich, custom Morse code jewelry, perfect for gifting and self-expression. Help others discover the beauty of hidden messages and find the perfect gift for every occasion.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong>Product description</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer mens and womens Morse code bracelets.&nbsp; &nbsp;(See images)</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><br><strong>USP</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">People love gifting products that they know their friends and family will idenitfy with and they love buying from small family owned businesses.&nbsp; Our bracelets check both those boxes.&nbsp; We can create any word less than 10 characters.&nbsp; We are family owned business located in Oregon and process most orders within 24hrs.&nbsp; We ship using USPS 2-5 day ground advantage shipping.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><br><strong>Payment terms</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Every 30 days via PayPal or Venmo currently.&nbsp; We are just getting started.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>We can offer you a 10% off coupon for your customers to use.&nbsp; Just let us know.</p>",
